WEBVTT

00:10.550 --> 00:12.030
Oh, man...

00:12.860 --> 00:15.910
It's seriously on its way over here.

00:15.910 --> 00:17.320
What should I do?

00:20.790 --> 00:23.450
I mean, what else can I do?

00:39.340 --> 00:43.610
I guess I'll wait. His voice was so shaky.

00:46.440 --> 00:50.460
Be careful. Make sure you
stay behind the umbrella.

00:50.460 --> 00:52.780
This is Mob's power?

00:53.090 --> 00:55.930
I don't believe he's doing this willingly.

00:55.930 --> 00:59.990
He must've suffered some kind of shock,
sending his powers out of control.

01:00.350 --> 01:03.440
Serizawa, is that unusual?

01:03.440 --> 01:04.690
Sorry, what?!

01:05.720 --> 01:08.040
I don't think it is.

01:09.670 --> 01:11.240
What's wrong, Serizawa?!

01:11.610 --> 01:15.000
I'm sorry, Reigen. Let's turn back.

01:15.000 --> 01:16.590
We came this far! What's gotten into you?!

01:16.920 --> 01:20.850
It feels like my energy is being
stolen away at an alarming rate.

01:20.850 --> 01:24.380
If this keeps up, I won't
be able to protect you.

01:24.800 --> 01:27.190
We need to get away from here immediately.

01:27.710 --> 01:29.960
In that case, go on and head back.

01:29.960 --> 01:30.570
Huh?

01:30.970 --> 01:33.220
I'll be fine on my own from here on out.

01:33.220 --> 01:35.290
There's no way you'll be fine!

01:35.520 --> 01:38.090
There's something I want to
talk to Mob about alone.

01:38.740 --> 01:40.550
Let me go alone.

01:40.550 --> 01:41.230
Reigen!

01:53.336 --> 01:55.046
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:56.166 --> 01:57.916
(MOB MOB WOW!)

01:59.086 --> 02:00.756
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:01.926 --> 02:03.596
(MOB MOB WOW!)

02:05.006 --> 02:07.726
I realized that our youth is gray

02:07.726 --> 02:10.646
The origin of this uneasiness
Is yet unknown

02:10.726 --> 02:13.146
Trains of emotions keep running
Through my brain

02:13.146 --> 02:16.316
Struggling through this adolescence

02:16.436 --> 02:19.276
Don't disturb my deep psyche

02:19.276 --> 02:21.946
Who is that behind you?

02:22.066 --> 02:25.736
Opposing ideas creates distortion

02:25.736 --> 02:29.156
Exorcise all the sorrow

02:29.326 --> 02:32.826
So, do what you can now

02:32.916 --> 02:34.746
My life

02:34.996 --> 02:38.876
Finally, break it down

02:40.376 --> 02:43.216
(Want) Both greed
(Young) And honesty

02:43.216 --> 02:46.096
(Burn) Are growing
(1) On this chest of mine

02:46.096 --> 02:48.846
(Trance) I'm not waking up
(Chance) I want to wake up

02:48.846 --> 02:51.806
(Stance) These two different faces of mine
(1) Are standing back-to-back

02:51.806 --> 02:54.306
Taking things as it is

02:54.306 --> 02:57.726
In this free relation where
We resent each other

02:57.816 --> 03:00.026
Once these two become one

03:00.026 --> 03:02.026
That smile becomes one

03:02.026 --> 03:05.116
And only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:05.776 --> 03:08.786
"1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:09.116 --> 03:10.196
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:10.196 --> 03:13.076
One and only "1"
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:13.246 --> 03:14.786
"1"

03:14.786 --> 03:15.956
(MOB MOB WOW!)

03:15.956 --> 03:18.246
One and only "1"

03:24.590 --> 03:26.980
I can't go to Tsubomi like this.

03:28.650 --> 03:30.610
If she ever saw me like this...

03:31.220 --> 03:35.980
But this form is exactly what
Tsubomi needs to see.

03:36.280 --> 03:40.540
If she can still accept me,
I couldn't be happier.

03:41.430 --> 03:44.840
Ever since Tsubomi lost
interest in my powers,

03:44.840 --> 03:47.160
you stopped using them.

03:47.970 --> 03:50.760
But that was the wrong decision.

03:51.510 --> 03:55.510
You don't think changing yourself
for someone you love is natural?

03:55.870 --> 03:59.010
I don't. At least, not when
we're talking about Tsubomi.

04:00.070 --> 04:02.680
You should try to remember why
you liked her in the first place.

04:04.560 --> 04:06.310
It's because we got along...

04:07.200 --> 04:08.390
No.

04:08.820 --> 04:13.720
Tsubomi didn't treat me any differently
even though I could use psychic powers.

04:14.550 --> 04:18.810
She was kind
to the both of us as a friend.

04:20.770 --> 04:22.390
She accepted us.

04:25.530 --> 04:28.940
It wasn't you that fell in love
with Tsubomi...

04:30.140 --> 04:31.150
It was me.

04:36.150 --> 04:36.960
Mob!

04:37.190 --> 04:39.418
- Mob! Hey, Mob! Can you hear me? It's me!

04:39.420 --> 04:40.926
- That's...
- Mob! Hey, Mob! Can you hear me? It's me!

04:41.380 --> 04:44.910
Master doesn't treat me any differently.

04:46.190 --> 04:48.820
You can stop pretending now.

04:48.820 --> 04:50.640
That man is a liar.

04:50.910 --> 04:51.730
Mob!

04:52.090 --> 04:54.670
Master has saved me so many times.

04:55.400 --> 04:57.100
That's only because you were worth using.

04:57.590 --> 05:01.970
That man is only interested in
using my powers for his work.

05:03.240 --> 05:08.070
Meaning he gave me more different
and more special treatment than anyone else.

05:09.300 --> 05:11.940
That's all there is between us.

05:12.350 --> 05:14.540
But it'll all be okay now.

05:15.480 --> 05:18.120
No stranger can tame me.

05:18.660 --> 05:21.740
Once he sees my true form, he'll also...

05:22.940 --> 05:25.860
Just look at him. That shocked face.

05:28.510 --> 05:31.810
See? He's already frightened of me.

05:31.810 --> 05:33.750
He can't even come over here.

05:34.990 --> 05:39.760
Mob... Mob! Come back!

05:42.720 --> 05:44.130
I had no idea...

05:45.350 --> 05:46.430
that this...

05:47.150 --> 05:49.870
This is what you've been
holding in all this time?

05:50.460 --> 05:52.150
And yet, I...

05:53.280 --> 05:54.650
I had no idea...

05:55.710 --> 05:57.540
I truly had no idea!

05:57.540 --> 05:58.760
Master!

06:00.720 --> 06:01.840
I'm sorry.

06:06.120 --> 06:07.060
Mob?

06:07.910 --> 06:08.810
Mob!

06:11.100 --> 06:12.150
Wait!

06:18.650 --> 06:20.360
I have something to say to you!

06:28.820 --> 06:30.000
I have to...

06:32.390 --> 06:34.570
Mob, please listen!

06:36.400 --> 06:38.540
Please... I need to...

06:47.400 --> 06:48.390
Mob!

07:12.650 --> 07:13.670
Mob!

07:14.620 --> 07:16.650
I didn't want to lose to you,

07:17.180 --> 07:20.420
so I was secretly working out, too!

08:48.110 --> 08:51.510
Just... listen to me for a bit.

08:51.770 --> 08:55.070
No... I can't listen to him.

08:55.870 --> 08:58.300
I've finally been freed.

09:16.740 --> 09:18.700
(Seasoning Park)

09:32.150 --> 09:33.660
I'll be able to see her soon...

09:38.390 --> 09:39.720
Hey, Mob...

09:41.170 --> 09:44.330
There's something I haven't been
able to tell you for a while now.

09:53.260 --> 09:54.330
Wait...

09:54.850 --> 09:57.000
Does he actually possess this much power?

09:57.930 --> 10:01.070
There's something I need
to tell you right now...

10:01.940 --> 10:04.060
before you go see Tsubomi.

10:12.960 --> 10:16.130
Heya... You seem well.

10:18.270 --> 10:21.260
It's been a while, Shigeo.

10:31.250 --> 10:32.520
Shigeo.

10:32.990 --> 10:36.880
Because you've been waiting
for me deep down inside,

10:36.880 --> 10:39.980
it looks like
I wasn't destroyed after all.

10:40.260 --> 10:45.440
And then I was able to come back because
I was drawn into this spiral of power.

10:45.960 --> 10:49.450
Partner, let's hear
what Reigen has to say.

10:50.220 --> 10:53.240
I just happened to run
into Dimple over there.

10:53.240 --> 10:54.830
And because of that, we made it in time.

10:54.830 --> 10:58.160
Hey, no time to chitchat, buddy.

10:58.390 --> 11:01.680
I'm basically giving it my all
right now to literally exist.

11:01.890 --> 11:04.460
Yeah, it seems like it.

11:05.020 --> 11:08.530
Dimple,
I know you just saved me and all...

11:08.530 --> 11:10.060
but could you give us a minute?

11:10.060 --> 11:13.770
What? The hell are you gonna do?!

11:16.960 --> 11:21.000
Tch. Fine, then.
Don't you start fighting, though.

11:24.230 --> 11:25.160
Mob.

11:26.390 --> 11:29.340
I... I...

11:30.750 --> 11:32.280
I don't...

11:32.870 --> 11:36.620
have any spiritual... or psychic powers...

11:38.670 --> 11:41.010
I don't have any powers!

11:41.300 --> 11:43.100
I never did!

11:47.470 --> 11:50.430
(Seasoning Park)

12:00.280 --> 12:05.300
It was a lie.
It was a lie... from the start.

12:18.640 --> 12:21.850
Oh, excuse me. My allergies.

12:28.020 --> 12:34.172
I lie a lot.
To my customers... and to you.

12:35.726 --> 12:38.320
The first day
that you came to my office...

12:39.130 --> 12:40.950
I lied to you.

12:41.990 --> 12:44.780
I heard you out, thinking I had some idea
of what you were going through.

12:45.350 --> 12:47.640
But you believed me so easily.

12:48.370 --> 12:52.590
That's why from that day on
until today... I've been...

12:53.230 --> 12:55.670
I've been using you this entire time.

13:01.510 --> 13:05.090
The truth is...
I don't know a damn thing...

13:05.750 --> 13:07.480
about psychic powers.

13:11.570 --> 13:12.610
This is...

13:13.630 --> 13:15.210
the real me.

13:19.100 --> 13:21.590
I'm sorry that I acted like
your master the whole time.

13:22.500 --> 13:25.530
But let me just say one last thing!

13:26.380 --> 13:29.090
This doesn't make you
different or special.

13:29.430 --> 13:32.040
Everyone has another side to them.

13:32.280 --> 13:33.290
Even me!

13:33.810 --> 13:35.810
So you don't need to worry so much.

13:36.260 --> 13:39.030
Actually... I guess it's okay to worry.

13:39.030 --> 13:41.650
Because that's also just
a natural thing to do.

13:42.430 --> 13:44.320
Just between you and me...

13:44.320 --> 13:48.250
I absolutely despise the
other side I'm hiding...

13:48.640 --> 13:53.210
But it's because of my lies
that you came into my life.

13:53.210 --> 13:57.500
And you're who you are today
because of your powers, aren't you?

13:58.980 --> 14:02.200
Er... What I'm trying to say here is...

14:03.410 --> 14:05.870
You're fine... just the way you are.

14:06.600 --> 14:09.210
You don't need me anymore.

14:09.210 --> 14:10.230
You'll be fine.

14:10.710 --> 14:13.810
Just go ahead and accept yourself already.

14:14.770 --> 14:19.090
You'll be able to do that
because you're you, Mob.

14:19.090 --> 14:20.500
I know you can!

14:24.080 --> 14:26.050
You heard what Master said.

14:26.650 --> 14:29.830
Are you telling me that
you're going to accept me?

14:30.410 --> 14:34.150
No... I want you to accept me, too.

14:35.020 --> 14:37.080
Just like everyone else did.

14:38.680 --> 14:41.900
And you're okay with that...? Really?

14:45.310 --> 14:48.090
Let's go back to how things used to be.

14:49.100 --> 14:49.990
Wait...

14:50.440 --> 14:52.310
What if she turns you down?

14:53.690 --> 14:54.700
I'll...

14:56.030 --> 14:57.430
It'll be okay.

14:58.990 --> 14:59.790
Come on.

15:03.630 --> 15:04.600
Let's go.

15:15.560 --> 15:16.270
(Kageyama)

15:16.270 --> 15:16.970
(Shigeo)

15:16.970 --> 15:20.980
(Shigeo Kageyama)

15:31.410 --> 15:34.000
Dimple, let him go alone.

15:34.000 --> 15:37.360
Is Tsubomi even waiting for him?

15:37.590 --> 15:40.830
Mob's the only one who needs to know that.

15:46.630 --> 15:49.680
Reigen, what are you gonna do from now on?

15:49.680 --> 15:51.000
Beats me.

15:51.000 --> 15:54.130
Like you can talk, though.
Your color seems more muted now.

15:54.430 --> 15:56.740
Hey, he's coming back.

16:00.420 --> 16:01.840
I guess she wasn't there.

16:02.670 --> 16:04.280
I mean, who can blame her?

16:12.960 --> 16:14.000
She rejected me.

16:14.000 --> 16:15.080
What?!

16:15.080 --> 16:17.080
She was actually waiting there?

16:17.440 --> 16:21.180
She said that she still has yet
to see me in that way...

16:43.280 --> 16:44.400
I see.

16:46.230 --> 16:48.900
But, hey, things like this happen.

16:48.900 --> 16:50.570
Yeah, it's okay.

16:51.320 --> 16:53.670
At least she was actually waiting for you.

16:53.670 --> 16:56.340
Things are just getting started for you.

16:56.340 --> 16:57.030
Right...

16:57.960 --> 17:01.550
And you know... We're gonna have
to repair this city somehow.

17:01.550 --> 17:05.320
But don't you worry.
I'm sure everyone will help out.

17:05.320 --> 17:08.500
Oh, I know. That one guy who
fixed your house before.

17:08.500 --> 17:12.470
We can call him over.
You know plenty of other psychics, too.

17:12.470 --> 17:14.900
I'll call Serizawa, too.

17:18.720 --> 17:21.820
Oh, Serizawa?
Yeah, I'm totally fine. No worries.

17:21.820 --> 17:24.750
More importantly,
could you come over here?

17:27.730 --> 17:32.230
(Confession
~The Future~)

17:37.200 --> 17:38.128
(Body Improvement Club)

17:38.130 --> 17:39.730
Kageyamai!

17:40.030 --> 17:43.540
It's time to go running!
Captain Sagawa's calling for you.

17:43.540 --> 17:45.410
Okay, I'll be right there!

17:46.030 --> 17:49.850
So, yeah... Leave your schedule
open at the end of the year.

17:49.850 --> 17:52.410
I'll be going with you guys this year.

17:52.410 --> 17:54.750
Sure. I'll look forward to it.

17:54.750 --> 17:57.360
I wonder if the UFO will come again.

17:58.480 --> 17:59.940
There's no doubt about it.

18:02.010 --> 18:02.860
It'll come.

18:04.130 --> 18:06.040
Body Improvement!

18:06.040 --> 18:08.890
Fight on! Fight on! Fight on!

18:08.890 --> 18:10.640
Body Improvement!

18:10.640 --> 18:13.690
Fight on! Fight on! Fight on!

18:13.690 --> 18:15.650
Body Improvement!

18:15.650 --> 18:18.600
Fight on! Fight on! Fight on!

18:19.500 --> 18:22.770
It's been six months since you've joined.

18:22.770 --> 18:24.820
Everyone's running a lot better now.

18:25.240 --> 18:28.340
Last year, I'd get anemic pretty quickly,

18:28.610 --> 18:31.200
but I was able to get this far
thanks to everyone else.

18:31.200 --> 18:34.500
So let's all help each other out
when things get rough.

18:34.770 --> 18:35.740
Right!

18:37.830 --> 18:39.390
How are things going lately?

18:39.770 --> 18:42.230
Is it rough being the vice president?

18:42.230 --> 18:43.800
I guess it depends on how motivated I am.

18:44.290 --> 18:48.430
I'm starting to understand that the seniors
before us were pretty ambitious.

18:48.900 --> 18:51.390
How are you doing as the vice captain?

18:51.840 --> 18:53.920
We have a lot of members now,
so it's really fun.

18:53.920 --> 18:58.050
Next week, we're going to a training boot
camp with Musashi and the others.

18:58.050 --> 18:59.480
Oh, yeah.

18:59.760 --> 19:03.700
Your younger brother looked like
he had some promising muscles.

19:04.070 --> 19:06.690
Why doesn't he join us, Kageyama?

19:07.230 --> 19:08.800
What do you think?

19:08.800 --> 19:14.310
No, I'm pretty busy with being vice
president, so I'm gonna pass.

19:21.170 --> 19:22.200
You okay?

19:22.200 --> 19:22.790
Yeah.

19:29.120 --> 19:30.460
Be careful!

19:39.800 --> 19:41.770
Th-Thank goodness.

19:43.320 --> 19:45.290
What are you even doing, Brother?

19:46.670 --> 19:48.590
Heya, Kageyama brothers.

19:48.950 --> 19:49.780
Teru.

19:50.020 --> 19:53.880
It's been a while. Are you heading
over there, too, Hanazawa?

19:53.880 --> 19:55.810
Yeah, let's head over together.

19:57.800 --> 20:00.660
But man, I've been so bored lately.

20:00.660 --> 20:02.740
Want to go shopping again?

20:02.740 --> 20:06.090
I heard the newest addition to
the Hagemon line is out.

20:06.090 --> 20:07.680
Sure, let's go.

20:07.840 --> 20:10.840
What?!
He's gonna wear that T-shirt again?!

20:10.840 --> 20:12.840
I need to actually stop him this time.

20:12.840 --> 20:16.320
I need to tell him it's okay
to wear whatever he wants!

20:16.750 --> 20:17.720
Brother...

20:24.940 --> 20:27.490
Did you want to go check out the
new Hagemon with us, too, Ritsu?

20:27.490 --> 20:31.640
Er, no... I'm busy with vice
president duties, so...

20:32.690 --> 20:35.380
I really love that T-shirt.

20:35.380 --> 20:36.350
Really?

20:40.200 --> 20:41.620
Hello.

20:41.620 --> 20:43.390
Oh, there he is.

20:43.880 --> 20:46.250
Hey, you three.

20:46.790 --> 20:48.500
Come on in and have a seat.

20:49.410 --> 20:50.980
Here, have some tea.

20:55.170 --> 20:57.800
Looks like Serizawa's
gotten used to the job.

20:57.800 --> 20:59.340
Yeah, he's doing great.

20:59.340 --> 21:01.880
Well, he's the backbone of this agency.

21:02.900 --> 21:06.010
It's been six months since I
started working here, as well.

21:06.010 --> 21:08.440
Aren't I starting to look the part?

21:08.910 --> 21:11.710
So how are things going with
you and your girlfriend?

21:11.710 --> 21:14.960
Sh-She's not my girlfriend!
She rejected me...

21:15.340 --> 21:17.060
They talk on the phone every now and then.

21:17.060 --> 21:18.910
Oh, excellent.

21:18.910 --> 21:19.680
Ritsu!

21:22.620 --> 21:24.970
President Kurata, we're here!

21:24.970 --> 21:27.410
Oh, there was someone else
at the entrance.

21:27.410 --> 21:28.960
They might be a client.

21:28.960 --> 21:29.670
Huh?

21:30.580 --> 21:31.900
Who the...?

21:31.900 --> 21:33.340
I invited them.

21:33.860 --> 21:37.640
Oh, I invited someone I know, too.
That's okay, right?

21:37.950 --> 21:41.280
Hey, Serizawa. How've you been, man?

21:41.280 --> 21:42.610
Suzuki!

21:42.610 --> 21:45.510
Hey, Ritsu! It's been a while.

21:45.510 --> 21:46.600
He's coming!

21:46.600 --> 21:49.030
President Kurata,
he'll be here any second!

21:49.410 --> 21:51.860
O-Okay! Okay, everyone! Hide!

21:51.860 --> 21:53.180
H-Hey!

21:56.910 --> 21:58.770
Man, I'm wiped.

21:58.770 --> 22:00.670
Yokai, my ass.

22:00.950 --> 22:03.870
It was just some old dude
with a butt chin.

22:03.870 --> 22:07.670
They kept nagging me to do an exorcism,
so I just randomly spread some salt.

22:07.670 --> 22:10.680
Isn't that what you always do?

22:11.830 --> 22:14.300
Huh? The lights're off...

22:14.300 --> 22:17.370
Hey, Serizawa! Tome?

22:18.650 --> 22:20.100
Anyone here?

22:25.420 --> 22:29.380
Happy birthday, Reigen!

22:34.570 --> 22:37.950
Happy birthday, Master Reigen.

22:37.950 --> 22:38.780
Mob...

22:39.260 --> 22:41.450
Go on. Blow out the candles.

22:41.450 --> 22:43.590
Hey, your eyes seem kinda red.

22:43.590 --> 22:45.740
Y-You dumbass! Dimple!

22:45.940 --> 22:48.700
What? You gonna cry, Reigen?

22:48.700 --> 22:49.810
What?!

22:50.140 --> 22:53.270
Aren't I a capable secretary?
Now raise my pay.

22:55.550 --> 22:57.970
Oh, no! My cake!

23:14.190 --> 23:16.700
Hey! Who just did that?!

23:17.160 --> 23:20.430
Aw, that sucks.
I sorta wanted to see you cry.

23:20.430 --> 23:22.910
There's a client heading here right now!

23:22.910 --> 23:25.270
What? I-Is there?

23:25.540 --> 23:29.320
You're all going to be helping me!
